  "retrieval": {
    "query": "信号量的 P 操作和 V 操作分别有什么作用？",
    "hits": [
      {
        "chunkId": "5f11a43d8a735370bb29b2ef0abcd0d33f19b217fd21040f5bd4218a0b194e20",
        "content": "初始化完成后，只能通过P()和V()操作修改\n",
        "provenance": {
          "documentId": "2097360470860251137",
          "documentTitle": "5.3OS_IPCandConcurrency-并发控制的方法-2024.pptx",
          "sourceLocation": "{\"startOffset\":12440,\"endOffset\":12463,\"headingPath\":[]}"
        },
        "score": 0.03125763125763126
      },
      {
        "chunkId": "df6af8e71fa21bbf71a78409dfdf21bfaf4d38e8b3880b18a4ae6d7c28beca0a",
        "content": "PV操作不能次序错误、重复或遗漏\n必须成对使用P()操作和V()操作\n■\n",
        "provenance": {
          "documentId": "2097360470860251137",
          "documentTitle": "5.3OS_IPCandConcurrency-并发控制的方法-2024.pptx",
          "sourceLocation": "{\"startOffset\":12859,\"endOffset\":12896,\"headingPath\":[]}"
        },
        "score": 0.031099324975891997
      },
      {
        "chunkId": "d38ce38ffbc6aaa7f0d99c8dac7ec7652c57be91b20183d3635be3e48dc74042",
        "content": "V()操作在使用后释放临界资源\nmutex = new Semaphore(1);\nmutex->P();\nCritical Section;\nmutex->V();\n每个临界区设置一个信号量，其初值为1\n",
        "provenance": {
          "documentId": "2097360470860251137",
          "documentTitle": "5.3OS_IPCandConcurrency-并发控制的方法-2024.pptx",
          "sourceLocation": "{\"startOffset\":12897,\"endOffset\":13000,\"headingPath\":[]}"
        },
        "score": 0.031054405392392875
      },
      {
        "chunkId": "f2beb53afcd3b250688d1e1a8501401fd571518e20d708bedfeb514096b4f453",
        "content": "P()操作保证互斥访问临界资源\n",
        "provenance": {
          "documentId": "2097360470860251137",
          "documentTitle": "5.3OS_IPCandConcurrency-并发控制的方法-2024.pptx",
          "sourceLocation": "{\"startOffset\":12842,\"endOffset\":12858,\"headingPath\":[]}"
        },
        "score": 0.030776515151515152
      },
      {
        "chunkId": "674856113a4d8de768624fb71dbbae7b9101c95bac81a369725d2c55e2cb6d74",
        "content": "由操作系统保证，PV操作是原子操作\n",
        "provenance": {
          "documentId": "2097360470860251137",
          "documentTitle": "5.3OS_IPCandConcurrency-并发控制的方法-2024.pptx",
          "sourceLocation": "{\"startOffset\":12464,\"endOffset\":12482,\"headingPath\":[]}"
        },
        "score": 0.03021353930031804
      },
      {
        "chunkId": "73f8b2d97f8b1525614057b9c6bfbc0cf409bfe97c0c29c4bcaa6fc914a55632",
        "content": "信号量的特性\nP() 可能阻塞，V()不会阻塞\n■\n",
